      "type": "markdown",
      "text": "Here is the plan:\n\n- **Classify** the request with the fast model\n- **Plan** steps when thinking is above low\n- **Judge** the result before answering\n\n```rust\nfn route(level: Level) -> Route {\n    match level {\n        Level::Low => Route::Fast,\n        _ => Route::Thinking,\n    }\n}\n```\n\nThen the router sends it: use `Route::Fast` for quick answers and keep an eye on the **budget**."
     }
